    "/wikiloc/v1/trail": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "wikilocTrail",
        "summary": "Wikiloc trail",
        "description": "One Wikiloc trail: name (and its English translation), activity, breadcrumb places, nearest place, distance, route type, loop flag, elevation gain, loss, max and min (metres and feet), difficulty, TrailRank, moving and total time, number of points, upload and recording dates, start and end points, rating and number of ratings, claps, views, downloads, description, author, waypoints (name, type, position, elevation, time, photos), photos and every review and comment (author, date, stars, text). With `geometry=true` also the full recorded line as `[longitude, latitude, altitude_m, time_ms]` points.\n\nEvery response includes `credits_used`: the credits this call cost.\n\nPrice: 1 credit per successful call. Docs: https://api.sh/docs/wikiloc-trail",
